    "notes": "The Guggenheim Bilbao exterior includes the curved titanium masses, limestone galleries, river atrium and canopy, plus the lowered city entrance with its stepped plaza and west-side promenade flight. The entrance and plaza elevations, intermediate tread dimensions and west stair count are fitted from ordinary photographs and the standard terrain. Exterior accessibility hardware and exact elevation survey remain outside this reconstruction. The museum exterior retains photo-led shell profiles, gallery heights and joints. La Salve Bridge, independent artworks and museum interiors remain separate."
  },
